WEBVTT

00:06:57.496 --> 00:07:01.625
but reaching far beyond
what anyone thought accessible.

00:07:02.293 --> 00:07:04.128
Or approachable.

00:07:05.671 --> 00:07:06.964
Or doable.

00:07:08.257 --> 00:07:12.344
Breaking the banking rules
became my daily ritual.

00:07:13.971 --> 00:07:19.101
I mean, who says a layer cake can't taste
like salty malty sweet pretzels?

00:07:19.894 --> 00:07:21.812
I mean, my culinary instructors for one.

00:07:21.854 --> 00:07:23.022
(Laughs)

00:07:23.022 --> 00:07:24.690
"Watch me," I'd think.

00:07:24.690 --> 00:07:25.858
And I'd take pretzels,

00:07:25.900 --> 00:07:28.360
toast them in the oven
to deepen their flavor,

00:07:28.402 --> 00:07:31.989
then grind them
into a powder-like consistency